Subject: [BioC] A question regarding the mean of M-values.
In-Reply-To: <6.2.1.2.1.20050429114944.02120cf0@imaphost.wehi.edu.au>
References: <200504281001.j3SA0cHv006984@hypatia.math.ethz.ch>
